The provided C# code contains several comment blocks starting with "@@@". As per the problem prompt, the C# code for outputting assert statements corresponding to these comments is to extract these lines of code, extract certain patterns from them, and then formulate assert statements that will be used to verify the test-cases. 

However, please note that the provided code doesn't specify the conditions under which the assert statement (i.e., the if condition within Debug.Assert(...)) should be true. In these cases, the assert statements may not meet the same conditions as the given C# code does, and their functionality would need to be adjusted for accuracy.--------------------